  "description": "Strong Western is a bold and rugged display font inspired by classic western typography and vintage cowboy aesthetics. Designed to bring strength, character, and a rustic western feel to your creative projects, this font works perfectly for posters, logos, branding, t-shirts, signage, and retro-themed designs. Its strong letterforms and balanced spacing make it highly readable while maintaining an authentic western personality.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Strong Western is a bold and rugged display font inspired by classic western typography and vintage cowboy aesthetics. Designed to bring strength, character, and a rustic western feel to your creative projects, this font works perfectly for posters, logos, branding, t-shirts, signage, and retro-themed designs. Its strong letterforms and balanced spacing make it highly readable while maintaining an authentic western personality.</p>",
